 ## Running
 
 ```
-PULSE_API_TOKEN=change-me cargo run
+cargo run
+```
+
+Without `PULSE_API_TOKEN` the server uses the token `pulse-dev-token`, so you can
+try the API locally right away:
+
+```
+curl -H "Authorization: Bearer pulse-dev-token" localhost:8080/monitors
 ```
 
 | Variable | Default | Meaning |
 |---|---|---|
-| `PULSE_API_TOKEN` | required | Bearer token for every endpoint except `/health` |
+| `PULSE_API_TOKEN` | `pulse-dev-token` | Bearer token for every endpoint except `/health` |
 | `PULSE_PORT` | `8080` | HTTP port |
 | `PULSE_DB` | `pulse.db` | SQLite file |
 | `PULSE_CHECK_INTERVAL_SECS` | `60` | Seconds between check cycles |
